<title>USA: H&amp;R Block Inc Q3 Jan 31 loss widens.</title>
<headline>H&amp;R Block Inc Q3 Jan 31 loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>KANSAS CITY, Mo. 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr  loss		  $0.24     loss	$ 0.05</p>
<p> Net  loss		 25,326     loss	 5,481</p>
<p> Revs		     363,064		  311,845</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 104,041		  103,361</p>
<p>	 (All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>			9 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $1.46     loss	 $0.08</p>
<p> Net loss		 151,680     loss	 8,543</p>
<p> Revs		     843,772		  734,253</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 103,960		  104,069</p>
<p>	 (All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1997 9-month results include pretax charges recorded by CompuServe Corp of $17.7 million in Q1 and $7.9 million in Q2.</p>
<p>1997 9-month results also include an acceleration of amortization of previously capitalized acquisition costs of $45.3 million, pretax, recorded by CompuServe in the Q2.</p>
<p>On May 1, 1995, the company sold Meca Software Inc, exclusive of the rights to publish TaxCut, for a pretax gain of $12.4 million. It also recorded a Q1 $8.4 million writedown of impaired assets associated with the personal tax software.</p>
<p>	     ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
</text>
